WIRE.md §8.1 directory mode: the teamboard fixture of teamboard_test.go, one section per
output file, written by go test -update.
-- intents.json --
{
  "$schema": "teamboard.Intent@f8b4a7c0",
  "rows": [
    {"$id": "issue", "tone": "warning", "icon": "alert-triangle", "label": "Something is wrong", "minRole": "gm_junior"},
    {"$id": "idea", "tone": "accent", "icon": "lightbulb", "label": "Idea or request", "minRole": "gm_junior"}
